{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa's Stories"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Fresh Start"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe plans for the organization of events."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le03ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Future Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you use the Future tense in the negative form, you can use the auxiliary will. </br><span class=\"italic\">Structure: will </span><span class=\"italic strong\">not</span> + base form of the verb </br><span class=\"italic\">Short Form:  </span><span class=\"strong italic\">won't</span> + base form of the verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use this form to: </br><ul><li>describe a simple action in the future </br> <span class=\"italic\">They won't help us prepare the meals.</span> </br><il><li> make a prediction </br> <span class=\"italic\">The manager won't give you a raise with that behaviour. </span><il></ul>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quantifiers "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something. They can be used with countable and uncountable nouns. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">all </br>enough </br>no/none</br> not any </br>some </br>any </br>a lot of </br>lots of </br>plenty of</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">We have to peel all the tomatoes.  </br>We prepare all the the menus.  </br>There are plenty of chances to work with them.  </br>You have lots of information to review. </span>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "training session"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period dedicated to a specific activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a training session with the kitchen manager. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs in restaurants. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to oversee "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be in charge of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You will oversee the food production. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "day-to-day"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "happening every day"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are in charge of day-to-day tasks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "operation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the work or activities done by a business or organization"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here is a list of the restaurant's operations. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "food preparation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "preparing food for eating"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:You will be directing all food preparation. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kitchen helper"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "someone who keeps the kitchen at a restaurant clean and in order"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You'll support the training of kitchen helpers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to require"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to need something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You won't be required to keep track of them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to monitor"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to watch and notice changes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You don't have to monitor the supplies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inventory"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a list of all the things in a place"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are not looking over the inventory."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "menu planner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who organizes meals in advance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can work with the menu planners to create new dishes."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le03ob05aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a job you would like to have."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 6-7 sentences about the actions you have to do in this job. Remember to use the Simple Future tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 1 sentence about an event that happens in this job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences aloud to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the their sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use the Simple Future tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner's sentences. "}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le03ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le03ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi. I'm looking for Colette Brown. I have a training session with her.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: You must be Vanessa. Nice to meet you. I'm Colette. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Pleasure to meet you.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: How are you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm well. I'm looking forward to learning about this position.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Great. Let's get started. There is lots of information you'll need to review.\n</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ok.", "id": 1, "time": "10", "image": "engenn5le03ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: First on the agenda is what is required of you. You'll oversee day-to-day production and operations in the kitchen. This includes planning and directing all food preparation. You'll support the training of kitchen helpers.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Alright.", "id": 2, "time": "19250", "image": "engenn5le03ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: We won't require you to monitor inventory.  </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mmm. What about menus? </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: There won't be plenty of opportunities to work with our menu planners but you'll have some.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Great. I enjoy that work.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Colette</span>: Fantastic. You'll participate in making new food products.", "id": 3, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn5le03ob05re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you know what a training session is?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Did you ever go to one?"}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about things, actions and events in the future."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can use words to describe general quantities. "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Let's do some training with Vanessa at the restaurant! "}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 1}]}], "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "type": "STI", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Vanessa is attending a session. What's it about? Why is she there?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "C